OL,3,GNEWSAStriking SEND staff 'devastated'  
OL,4,Aby shortages                           
OL,6,FSome teaching support staff at a school
OL,7,Ffor pupils with severe or profound     
OL,8,Flearning difficulties have gone on     
OL,9,Fstrike in a row over staff shortages.  
OL,11,FUplands School in Swindon, Wiltshire,  
OL,12,Fnotified parents last Wednesday that it
OL,13,Fwould be closed on 24 and 25 November. 
OL,15,FTeaching assistant Victoria Brown said 
OL,16,Fnot being able to provide the "best    
OL,17,Fcare" to students was "absolutely      
OL,18,Fdevastating".                          
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
