OL,3,GNEWSAStriking SEND staff 'devastated'  
OL,4,Aby shortages                           
OL,6,FDavid McMullen, from the GMB union,    
OL,7,Fsaid its members had been left in      
OL,8,F"unsafe situations" and had been left  
OL,9,Fwith "no choice" but to strike. The    
OL,10,FBrunel Academies Trust (BAT), which    
OL,11,Foversees Uplands, said it was "actively
OL,12,Frecruiting" staff and its priority     
OL,13,Fremained the well-being of staff and   
OL,14,Fstudents.                              
